# ── Waitlist admin export (api/waitlist.ts) ──
# REQUIRED for `GET /api/waitlist` to work at all. The endpoint returns every
# captured email address, so it fails closed with 503 when this is unset rather
# than falling back to a shared default. Generate a long random value and set it
# in the Vercel project settings for the marketing app; it is read from the
# x-waitlist-admin-token request header, never from the query string.
#   curl -H "x-waitlist-admin-token: $WAITLIST_ADMIN_TOKEN" https://sponsee.app/api/waitlist
WAITLIST_ADMIN_TOKEN=
